== Schedule and venues ==

The G1 Climax 2026 tour travels across all three of Okaiken's main islands — [[Harujima]], [[Ishijima]], and [[Yagikoshu]] — following the [[Shinkansen]] line where possible and utilizing ferry crossings for the island transitions. Each city hosts two tournament shows (one Block A, one Block B) to minimize travel. The tour is divided into four legs, moving generally from northeast to southwest, before returning to Aizawa for the final.

=== Leg 1: Harujima (September 5–11) ===

The tournament opens on Harujima, Okaiken's main island, with two shows in the capital [[Okami]] followed by two shows in [[Tokuyama]]. Both cities are on the Shinkansen line, approximately one hour apart.

